# ABDM Overview for Hospitals

The Ayushman Bharat Digital Mission (ABDM) provides a
national framework for interoperable digital health records
in India.

## Core ABDM Components
- ABHA (Health ID)
- Health Information Exchange (HIE)
- Consent Manager
- Health Facility Registry (HFR)
- Healthcare Professional Registry (HPR)

## Why ABDM Matters for Hospitals
- Enables continuity of care across facilities
- Reduces data silos
- Supports national registries and analytics
- Improves patient access and transparency

## Key Insight
ABDM adoption should be integrated into hospital workflows, not treated as a parallel compliance exercise.
